<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Manugistics rated outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Manugistics rated outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities Inc said Thursday it raised its six-month rating on Manugistics Group Inc to outperform from market performer.</p>
<p>-- EVEREN's earnings per share estimates for the company are $0.94 for FY98 and $1.39 for FY99.</p>
<p>-- EVEREN said Manugistics's software licensing fees from supply chain management applications showed strong demand in the FY97 Q4.</p>
<p>-- Manugistics was up 2-3/8 at 367-1/2.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
